2026-09-25 M3 review F3: the weekly results listing is read from a cursor (the last day of the last complete listing, with a 2-day overlap; 10 days on a first run; at most 120 days back), every page up to totalCount; the cursor moves only after a complete listing. The daily run reads announcements one day at a time from its cursor to yesterday (3 days on a first run, at most 14), and insider-trading disclosures from the oldest one not read yet. source_health 'nse' records a success only when every listing was read in full.
